@page "/manage/maps"
@attribute [Authorize]
@* Interaktivní režim per stránka — layout zůstává SSR; bez toho by @onclick a @bind nefungovaly *@
@rendermode InteractiveServer
@inject IDbService Db

<PageTitle>@S["ManageMapsTitle"] — Metin2Bausia</PageTitle>

<h2>@S["ManageMapsTitle"]</h2>
<p class="text-muted mb-3">@S["ManageMapsIntro"]</p>

<div class="toolbar mb-3 d-flex gap-2 align-items-center flex-wrap">
    <input class="form-control form-control-sm" style="max-width:220px"
           placeholder="@S["SearchName"]" @bind="_search" @bind:event="oninput" />
    <select class="form-select form-select-sm" style="max-width:140px" @bind="_filterEnabled">
        <option value="">@S["All"]</option>
        <option value="true">@S["Enabled"]</option>
        <option value="false">@S["Disabled"]</option>
    </select>
    <span class="text-muted small ms-auto">@Filtered.Count() / @_maps.Count</span>
</div>

@if (_loading) { <p>@S["Loading"]</p> }
else
{
    <div class="table-responsive list-table">
        <table class="table table-sm table-hover align-middle">
            <thead class="table-dark">
                <tr>
                    <th style="width:56px">@S["On"]</th>
                    <SortableHeader Field="Index" Label="@S["ColIndex"]" @bind-SortBy="_sortBy" @bind-Ascending="_asc" />
                    <SortableHeader Field="Name" Label="@S["ColName"]" @bind-SortBy="_sortBy" @bind-Ascending="_asc" />
                    <th style="width:80px">@S["ColMinLevel"]</th>
                    <th style="width:80px">@S["ColMaxLevel"]</th>
                    <th style="width:100px">@S["Status"]</th>
                    <th style="width:50px"></th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                @foreach (var map in Sorted)
                {
                    <tr class="@(map.IsEnabled ? "" : "opacity-60")">
                        <td class="text-center">
                            <div class="form-check form-switch d-flex justify-content-center">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox"
                                       checked="@map.IsEnabled"
                                       @onchange="e => ToggleAsync(map, (bool)e.Value!)" />
                            </div>
                        </td>
                        <td><code class="small">@map.MapIndex</code></td>
                        <td><strong>@map.Name</strong>
                            @if (map.LocaleName != null) { <small class="text-muted"> (@map.LocaleName)</small> }
                        </td>
                        <td class="text-muted small">@map.MinLevel</td>
                        <td class="text-muted small">@map.MaxLevel</td>
                        <td><span class="badge @StatusClass(map.ContentStatus)">@map.ContentStatus</span></td>
                        <td><a href="/manage/maps/@map.Guid" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm py-0">→</a></td>
                    </tr>
                }
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>

    @* Mobil: místo posouvání do strany karty pod sebou *@
    <div class="list-cards">
        @foreach (var map in Sorted)
        {
            <div class="list-card @(map.IsEnabled ? "" : "opacity-60")">
                <div class="form-check form-switch m-0">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox"
                           checked="@map.IsEnabled"
                           @onchange="e => ToggleAsync(map, (bool)e.Value!)" />
                </div>
                <a class="list-card__main" href="/manage/maps/@map.Guid">
                    <div class="list-card__title">@(map.LocaleName ?? map.Name)</div>
                    <div class="list-card__meta">
                        <code class="small">@map.MapIndex</code>
                        <span class="badge bg-light text-dark">@S["Level"] @map.MinLevel–@map.MaxLevel</span>
                        <span class="badge @StatusClass(map.ContentStatus)">@map.ContentStatus</span>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <span class="text-muted">›</span>
            </div>
        }
    </div>
}

<ToastMessage Text="@ToastText" IsError="@ToastIsError" Stamp="@ToastStamp" />

@code {
    private bool _loading = true;
    private List<ManageMap> _maps = new();
    private string _search = "";
    private string _filterEnabled = "";
    private string _sortBy = "Index";
    private bool _asc = true;

    private IEnumerable<ManageMap> Filtered => _maps.Where(m =>
        (string.IsNullOrEmpty(_search) || m.Name.Contains(_search, StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase)) &&
        (string.IsNullOrEmpty(_filterEnabled) || m.IsEnabled.ToString().ToLower() == _filterEnabled));

    private IEnumerable<ManageMap> Sorted =>
        _sortBy == "Name"
            ? (_asc ? Filtered.OrderBy(m => m.LocaleName ?? m.Name) : Filtered.OrderByDescending(m => m.LocaleName ?? m.Name))
            : (_asc ? Filtered.OrderBy(m => m.MapIndex) : Filtered.OrderByDescending(m => m.MapIndex));

    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync()
    {
        _loading = true;
        try
        {
            _maps = (await Db.QueryAsync<ManageMap>(
                @"SELECT ""Guid"", ""MapIndex"", ""Name"", ""LocaleName"",
                         ""MinLevel"", ""MaxLevel"", ""ContentStatus"", ""IsEnabled""
                  FROM ""Maps"" WHERE ""IsDeleted"" = FALSE
                  ORDER BY ""IsEnabled"" DESC, ""MapIndex"" ASC NULLS LAST")).ToList();
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { ShowError(ex); }
        finally { _loading = false; }
    }

    private async Task ToggleAsync(ManageMap map, bool newValue)
    {
        var old = map.IsEnabled;
        map.IsEnabled = newValue;
        try
        {
            await Db.ExecuteAsync(
                @"UPDATE ""Maps"" SET ""IsEnabled"" = @v, ""IsEnabledLocked"" = TRUE, ""UpdatedAt"" = NOW() WHERE ""Guid"" = @g",
                new { v = newValue, g = map.Guid });
            ShowOk(newValue ? S["TurnedOn", map.Name] : S["TurnedOff", map.Name]);
        }
        catch (Exception ex) { map.IsEnabled = old; ShowError(ex); }
    }

    private static string StatusClass(string? s) => s switch
    {
        "approved" => "bg-success", "pending" => "bg-warning text-dark", _ => "bg-secondary"
    };
}
